Compiled dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Python native wheels and Java native libraries include Rust dependencies.
Their licenses and notices are collected in
packages/structured-data-models-client/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES-RUST.txt.
Optional Python connector dependencies are resolved at installation time.

The offline schema visualization includes Mermaid 11.15.0, distributed under
the MIT license, and its bundled dependencies.
The upstream license, source and full dependency attribution are retained in
packages/structured-data-models-client/src/sdm_client/assets/MERMAID_LICENSE,
VENDORED.md and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES-MERMAID.txt in that directory.
Both Python and Java distributions include these resources.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Test data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

One data set is copied into this repository as test data. It ships in no
distribution.

contract/bases.yaml (the adventureworks base)
---------------------------------------------

A subset of 1,000 rows of Microsoft's AdventureWorks sample database, from
github.com/microsoft/sql-server-samples at commit
b47eadc85277f72843647223cde53aa1b85ffcb8, MIT licensed, Copyright (c)
Microsoft Corporation. contract/fixtures/adventureworks/build.py writes it;
contract/fixtures/adventureworks/README.md records the source files and
their SHA-256, and contract/fixtures/adventureworks/LICENSE.txt carries the
licence text as the source repository does.

First-party source, including the Rust Predictive Query Language implementation,
is maintained by NVIDIA under the license above.
Vendored test data and dependency notices retain their respective terms.
